{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ef40ee3e-e1b6-81ae-bab7-1fb7a2ba4e53",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T13:50:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisol Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:46:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:46:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. Um, my trash bin is gone. The city one, the big wheeled one. It was out at the curb for pickup and after the truck came, it just wasn't there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:46:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Gone as in the truck took it, or somebody walked off with it, you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know. [pause] Sorry, I'm on a treadmill, I'm a little out of breath. I looked up and down the street, and nothing. The neighbors' bins are all back at their houses."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. So what day was the pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:47:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This morning. Monday. I put it out last night, and when I came home from the store around noon, nothing at the curb, nothing in the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Pickup Monday, bin missing after. And can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:47:35-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-five Chapel Street. It's up on the Hill, if you come up from the, you know, where the bank used to be, and turn there. It's the third house in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twenty-five Chapel. Okay, I've got that. And is it the trash bin or the recycling one that's missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:47:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trash. The recycling one is still here, it's in the side yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, trash only. So, to get a replacement, we put in a request on our end. I can take it right now. Do you have a name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:48:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Marisol Herrera. H-E-R-R-E-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:48:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Marisol Herrera, got it. And a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:48:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-zero. Perfect. Now, I'll note the bin went missing after this morning's pickup, so the crew knows it may have been picked up by accident or taken. Does it have your house number or anything painted on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:48:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I never wrote on it. It's just the regular green one. Should I have?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:48:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not required, but it helps. When the new one comes, you can put your number on the side with a marker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:49:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll do that. How long does it usually take to get the new one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:49:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few business days, depending on how many requests are ahead of it. It gets dropped at the property, so you don't need to be home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:49:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And in the meantime, what do I do with the trash? I've got bags piling up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:49:27-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For now, keep the bags inside or in something with a tight lid so animals don't get into it. If the new bin isn't there before your next pickup day, call us back and we'll see what to do about that week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:49:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. So I don't need to fill out anything online or come down there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:49:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I'm entering it now. You're all set. I've got twenty-five Chapel Street, replacement trash bin, missing after Monday pickup, callback at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:50:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:50:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Marisol. Enjoy the rest of your workout."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T13:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
